{"id":"n34811-3-6","stage":2,"title":"구르다 · 滚","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n34811-3-6-1","ko":"무릎은 어쩌다 다친 거야?","zh":"膝盖是怎么受伤的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무릎은","meaning":"膝盖","explanation":"무릎：膝盖；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"무릎","audio":"/audio/a088ec9c747fb05fd92c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55313","senseId":"1","lemma":"무릎","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어쩌다","meaning":"意外地","explanation":"어쩌다：意外地","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14591","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다친","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"2","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a088ec9c747fb05f","term":"무릎","zh":"膝盖","audio":"/audio/a088ec9c747fb05fd92c.mp3","entryId":"55313","definition":"大腿和小腿中间向前凸出的呈圆形的部分。","pronunciation":["무릅"]},{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"意外地","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","entryId":"14591","definition":"不料偶然地。","pronunciation":["어쩌다"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/0250f1efc9feda31e61c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n34811-3-6-2","ko":"계단에서 굴렀어. 뛰어 내려오다가.","zh":"在楼梯上滚下来的，当时正在往下跑。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"계단에서","meaning":"阶梯，楼梯","explanation":"계단：阶梯，楼梯；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"계단","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23937","senseId":"1","lemma":"계단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"굴렀어.","meaning":"滚，打滚","explanation":"구르다：滚，打滚；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"구르다","audio":"/audio/140d9b165c63ec99bc01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34811","senseId":"3","lemma":"구르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뛰어","meaning":"跑，奔跑","explanation":"뛰다：跑，奔跑；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"뛰다","audio":"/audio/96e5ecf6b0d33341a17f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74124","senseId":"1","lemma":"뛰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내려오다가.","meaning":"下来","explanation":"내려오다：下来；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"내려오다","audio":"/audio/35192c2853ec6a6272bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64559","senseId":"1","lemma":"내려오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"cbd5d64a59da9222","term":"계단","zh":"阶梯，楼梯","audio":"/audio/cbd5d64a59da9222d592.mp3","entryId":"23937","definition":"为了上下走动而按顺序把小台阶倾斜连接起来的设施。","pronunciation":["계단","게단"]},{"id":"140d9b165c63ec99","term":"구르다","zh":"滚，打滚","audio":"/audio/140d9b165c63ec99bc01.mp3","entryId":"34811","definition":"躺在某个地方翻来翻去。","pronunciation":["구르다"]},{"id":"96e5ecf6b0d33341","term":"뛰다","zh":"跑，奔跑","audio":"/audio/96e5ecf6b0d33341a17f.mp3","entryId":"74124","definition":"快速挪动双脚，迅速向前行进。","pronunciation":["뛰다"]},{"id":"35192c2853ec6a62","term":"내려오다","zh":"下来","audio":"/audio/35192c2853ec6a6272bb.mp3","entryId":"64559","definition":"从高处来到低处或从上面来到下面。","pronunciation":["내려오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/06658eaf91687e722a82.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.285,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=34811","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/